      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At the cap\nHome: posts replaced in place by\n\"You're done for today\"\nHeader, stories tray, tab bar keep working\nMessages, Search, Profile stay open\nAn opened post shows only that post\nStories and Reels: full-screen overlay\nNothing more is counted",
